sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Service
    participant DB as MongoDB

    C->>S: POST redemption with Idempotency-Key
    S->>DB: R1 find by customer and key
    alt key found
        DB-->>S: record
        S-->>C: replay 200, or 409 REVERSED, or 422 KEY_REUSED
    else key not found
        S->>DB: R2 find active by customer and order
        alt active found
            S-->>C: replay 200, or 409 ORDER_ALREADY_HAS_COUPON
        else none active - R3
            S->>DB: load coupon by code
            S->>S: status, window and discount checks
            alt a check fails
                S-->>C: 404, 422 NOT_REDEEMABLE, or 422 DISCOUNT_EXCEEDS
            else checks pass
                Note over S: Continues in Figure 3, the transaction
            end
        end
    end
